# Every key named here is forwarded into the sandbox. A key with no value is
# filled from your shell's environment; a key your shell exports but this file
# does not name is NOT forwarded. Never commit `.env`.

# Claude Code OAuth token — get one by running `claude setup-token` on your host.
# Lets the agent use your Claude subscription instead of an API key.
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=
# Or use an Anthropic API key instead — uncomment:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# GitHub fine-grained token scoped to this repository only:
#   https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens/new
# Permissions: Issues (Read and write), Metadata (Read), Contents (Read).
# Deliberately no Contents: write and no Pull requests: write — commits come back
# over the bind mount and a person pushes and opens the pull request.
GH_TOKEN=
